   <media:description>Don't let the weather change the plan.
Stormburst is built for unpredictable days, wet trails, and whatever the forecast throws your way. Grab 15% off here: https://vessi.com/ltt
• Free shipping • 30‑day returns • 1‑year warranty

Linus is no stranger to 3D printers with toolchangers, but this is something totally different. By using induction heating, the Prusa INDX uses passive tools that make it smaller and more affordable than comparable systems.

Go check out The Next Layer: https://youtu.be/-i3SdKnfhgc

