While the Steam Machine has been out for a while now, Linus has been using it DAILY for the last several weeks and has some extra thoughts on the desktop experience that is SteamOS. Sure the gaming performance is mid on the steam machine, but when you are just using it for work, Linus believes it might be one of the best small form factor computers around!

