We’re already planning the Tech House home theater room, but we never did get around to adding any sound treatment to Linus’ personal movie room at his house! Today we’re finally setting him up properly with some DIY acoustic panels made of rockwool (and some optional sonopan) on the walls and ceiling. We’re using the mirror trick to determine where they should go, and testing the results using Room EQ Wizard. Featuring Dan and DMS!

